RANGE 19478-19485
19478: \misctitle{Warning} Make sure you understand the above! By default, most of
19479: the \kbd{bnf} routines depend on the correctness of the GRH. In particular,
19480: any of the class number, class group structure, class group generators,
19481: regulator and fundamental units may be wrong, independently of each other.
19482: Any result computed from such a \kbd{bnf} may be wrong. The only guarantee is
19483: that the units given generate a subgroup of finite index in the full unit
19484: group. You must use \kbd{bnfcertify} to certify the computations
19485: unconditionally.
